msgstr "smartedit-qt (Instruksi Peluncuran)"

# Translated with gpt-4.1-mini
#: ../developers.rst:168
msgid ""
"This is our main PyQt Python application. Because it is written in Python, "
"it does not require any compiling to run. To launch SmartEdit from the source "
"code with our newly-built ``libsmartedit-audio`` and ``libsmartedit`` "
"libraries, use the following commands:"
msgstr ""
"Ini adalah aplikasi utama PyQt Python kami. Karena ditulis dalam Python, "
"tidak memerlukan kompilasi untuk dijalankan. Untuk meluncurkan SmartEdit dari "
"kode sumber dengan perpustakaan ``libsmartedit-audio`` dan ``libsmartedit`` "
"yang baru dibangun, gunakan perintah berikut:"

# Translated with gpt-4.1-mini
#: ../developers.rst:179
msgid ""
"This should launch the SmartEdit user interface. Any changes you have made to "
"the source code files (``*.py`` Python files, ``*.ui`` PyQt UI files, "
"etc...) will be included. This requires the ``libsmartedit-audio`` and "
"``libsmartedit`` libraries, and if anything went wrong with the steps above, "
"SmartEdit will likely not launch."
msgstr ""
"Ini akan meluncurkan antarmuka pengguna SmartEdit. Setiap perubahan yang Anda "
"buat pada file kode sumber (file Python ``*.py``, file UI PyQt ``*.ui``, "
"dll...) akan disertakan. Ini memerlukan pustaka ``libsmartedit-audio`` dan "
"``libsmartedit``, dan jika ada yang salah dengan langkah-langkah di atas, "
"SmartEdit kemungkinan tidak akan meluncur."

# Translated with gpt-4.1-mini
#: ../developers.rst:185
msgid ""
"If SmartEdit launches at this point, congratulations! You now have a working "
"local version of SmartEdit, which is running off your local source code. Try "
"making some changes to the source code and re-launch SmartEdit... you should "
"now see your changes!"
msgstr ""
"Jika SmartEdit meluncur pada titik ini, selamat! Anda sekarang memiliki versi "
"lokal SmartEdit yang berfungsi, yang berjalan dari kode sumber lokal Anda. "
"Cobalah membuat beberapa perubahan pada kode sumber dan luncurkan kembali "
"SmartEdit... Anda sekarang harus melihat perubahan Anda!"

# Translated with gpt-4.1-mini
#: ../developers.rst:191
msgid "GitHub Issues"
msgstr "Masalah GitHub"

# Translated with gpt-4.1-mini
#: ../developers.rst:192
msgid ""
"Now that you have successfully compiled and launched SmartEdit Video Editor "
"from source code, be sure to check out our list of bug reports on GitHub: "
"`SmartEdit Issues`_. Also, you are encouraged to fill out our quick "
"`contributor form <https://forms.gle/CRqkS5tLMJE1V36V8>`_ and introduce "
"yourself!"
msgstr ""
"Sekarang setelah Anda berhasil mengompilasi dan meluncurkan SmartEdit Video "
"Editor dari kode sumber, pastikan untuk memeriksa daftar laporan bug kami di "
"GitHub: `Masalah SmartEdit`_. Selain itu, Anda dianjurkan untuk mengisi "
"`formulir kontributor <https://forms.gle/CRqkS5tLMJE1V36V8>`_ kami yang "
"singkat dan memperkenalkan diri Anda!"

# Translated with gpt-4.1-mini
#: ../developers.rst:198
msgid "Share your Changes"
msgstr "Bagikan Perubahan Anda"

# Translated with gpt-4.1-mini
#: ../developers.rst:199
msgid ""
"Once you have fixed a bug or added an amazing new feature, be sure to share "
"it with the SmartEdit team. Ideally, we can merge this into our main source "
"code branch. The easiest way to share your changes is by creating a fork of "
"our repo, pushing your changes back to GitHub, and creating a `Pull "
"Request`_. A Pull Request lets the SmartEdit team know you have changes ready "
"to be merged. Then we can review things, give feedback, and hopefully merge "
"your changes into the main branch."
msgstr ""
"Setelah Anda memperbaiki bug atau menambahkan fitur baru yang luar biasa, "
"pastikan untuk membagikannya dengan tim SmartEdit. Idealnya, kami dapat "
"menggabungkannya ke cabang kode sumber utama kami. Cara termudah untuk "
"membagikan perubahan Anda adalah dengan membuat fork dari repositori kami, "
"mendorong perubahan Anda kembali ke GitHub, dan membuat `Pull Request`_. "
"Pull Request memberi tahu tim SmartEdit bahwa Anda memiliki perubahan yang "
"siap digabungkan. Kemudian kami dapat meninjau, memberikan umpan balik, dan "
"semoga menggabungkan perubahan Anda ke cabang utama."
